@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

participant "Server" as S
participant "Broadcast (All Clients)" as B

== EndRoundState Entry ==

note over S: onEntry(): notifyPhaseObservers(END_ROUND) before onEntryActions()
loop for each active BuildingEffect (PhaseObserver)
    S ->> B: notifyPlayerResourceChanged(nickname, resource, newValue, delta)
end

S ->> B: notifyPhaseChanged(phase: END_ROUND, currentPlayer: null, resolutionOrder: null)

== Branching Logic ==

alt Branch 1: Extra Turn queued (extraTurnPlayerNickname != null)
    note over S: isExtraTurnMode = true\ncurrentPlayer = extraTurnPlayerNickname\ninitializeExtraPlayerLimits(...)
    S ->> B: notifyPlayerLimitsInitialized(nickname, remainingUpper, remainingLower)
    S ->> B: notifyPhaseChanged(phase: ACTION_RESOLUTION, currentPlayer: String, resolutionOrder: null)
    S ->> B: notifyExtraTurnStarted(nickname: String, remainingUpper: int, remainingLower: int)
    note right S: transitionTo(ActionResolutionState)\n(PhaseObservers suppressed during extra turn) — see diagram J

else Branch 2: Round Events to resolve (areRoundEventsToResolve == true)
    note right S: transitionTo(EventResolutionState) — see diagram G

else Branch 3: Default
    note right S: transitionTo(NewRoundState) — see diagram H
end
@enduml